Shell source imported from https://github.com/PM100Fun/NetNavr
at commit ca6002d580cef51cab869a3a65cbcddc2dfed3c1 (v0.2.33).
The repository split adds a pinned Core contract dependency, integration tests,
independent CI and repository community files. Legacy history is retained in
the source repository and is not imported into this repository.

The original NetNavr source uses OpenAI Codex and its SDK as dependencies.
Their licenses and notices remain with those dependency distributions.
Product 0.1 desktop assembly adapts selected MIT-licensed T3 Code source:
