The adaptation keeps platform titlebars, hidden first paint and first reveal,
safe window parameters, CJS desktop assembly and common runtime external policy.
Effect services, IDE databases, webviews, cloud/remote services, telemetry and
update servers are excluded. NetNavr's Core remains the data/contract authority.

